\title{Segalification and the Boardman–Vogt tensor product}
\date{2025-12-18}
\author/literal{Shaul Barkan}
\author/literal{Jan Steinebrunner}
\meta{venue}{[[agt]] 25(9)}
\meta{doi}{10.2140/agt.2025.25.5439}
\taxon{Reference}

\subtree{
\taxon{Abstract}
\p{
We develop an analog of [Dugger](danieldugger) and [Spivak](davidspivak)'s necklace
formula providing an explicit description of the Segal space generated by an
arbitrary simplicial space. We apply this to obtain a formula for the Segalification
of #{n}-fold simplicial spaces, a new proof of the invariance of right fibrations,
and a new construction of the Boardman–Vogt tensor product of #{\infty}-operads, for
which we also derive an explicit formula.
}
}

